; Interpolating a compound cost's missing number, v2 computes the per-unit
; cost from both parts, so short positions and inexact divisions may not
; balance; a compound missing both numbers, or one next to an amount-less
; posting, has too many missing numbers.
2020-01-01 open Assets:I
2020-01-01 open Assets:S
2020-01-01 open Assets:C

2020-01-02 * "both numbers left out"
  Assets:I  5 HOOL {# USD}
  Assets:C  -30 USD

2020-01-03 * "with an amount-less posting"
  Assets:I  5 HOOL {# 5 USD}
  Assets:C

2020-01-04 * "short, per-unit number left out"
  Assets:S  -5 GOOG {# 5 USD}
  Assets:C  30 USD

2020-01-05 * "short, total left out"
  Assets:S  -5 AAPL {5 # USD}
  Assets:C  30 USD

2020-01-06 * "inexact division"
  Assets:I  3 IBM {# 1.00 USD}
  Assets:C  -10 USD
